    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78002" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραθερμαίνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>warm, cheer</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶνος π. τὴν ψυχήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.
					5.185c
				</span></i>
			:— 
				Pass.
			, <i>to be heated</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				876b3
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραθερμανθείς</span>,
