				Aeschin.
				2.157
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρατεθέρμανται τῇ καρδίᾳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>De.</u>
					19.6
				</span></i>
			.</div>
